out the next rare black die.

257
00:12:51,620 --> 00:12:54,091
And I have a feeling it won't be long now.

258
00:12:54,220 --> 00:12:56,637
So start working on
your retirement speech.

259
00:12:56,720 --> 00:12:58,249
There's not much I can do.

260
00:12:58,620 --> 00:13:01,385
I'll just have to try
and build up my defenses.

261
00:13:02,020 --> 00:13:03,380
Go, dice roll!

262
00:13:05,280 --> 00:13:06,540
Two summons!

263
00:13:07,020 --> 00:13:08,140
Good roll, Yugi!

264
00:13:09,140 --> 00:13:10,680
Dimension the dice!

265
00:13:12,400 --> 00:13:16,000
Now, Devlin, let's see how
well I've learned your game.

266
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:19,300
I summon the Stripe Ninja!

267
00:13:20,380 --> 00:13:24,777
His high speed allows him to move
three spaces for each movement crest.

268
00:13:24,860 --> 00:13:26,360
High speed, huh?

269
00:13:26,640 --> 00:13:31,097
Nice try, but he doesn't come close to the
warp speed that my vortex will give me.

270
00:13:31,180 --> 00:13:34,400
Speaking of which, check out this baby.

271
00:13:35,060 --> 00:13:35,900
What is it?

272
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:38,500
It's my second black dot.

273
00:13:40,240 --> 00:13:45,520
Now I'll roll to complete the warp tube
and then finish you off for good. Oh, no!

274
00:13:46,600 --> 00:13:47,430
Yay!

275
00:13:48,780 --> 00:13:50,420
Go, dice roll!

276
00:13:53,260 --> 00:13:56,320
If he summons another
Warp Vortex, I'm finished!

277
00:14:01,700 --> 00:14:04,960
If Duke summons that Warp
Vortex, it's all over!

278
00:14:06,780 --> 00:14:08,500
Keep the faith, Yugi!

279
00:14:09,940 --> 00:14:11,580
This is him!

280
00:14:13,420 --> 00:14:14,980
No Warp Vortex!

281
00:14:15,340 --> 00:14:17,560
You lucked out this time!

282
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:21,180
Your turn, Yu-Gi.

283
00:14:22,820 --> 00:14:23,650
What?

284
00:14:23,780 --> 00:14:25,040
It's a...

285
00:14:25,820 --> 00:14:29,660
Devlin, I've just found a
major hole in your plan.

286
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:33,460
Or if you prefer, a vortex.

287
00:14:33,860 --> 00:14:35,040
Thanks to this.

288
00:14:35,540 --> 00:14:37,240
A black die? Hey!

289
00:14:38,520 --> 00:14:40,940
All right! Go! Dice roll!

290
00:14:43,160 --> 00:14:43,990
Excellent.

291
00:14:44,240 --> 00:14:46,180
A pair of summoning crests.

292
00:14:48,100 --> 00:14:49,660
Dimension the dice!

293
00:14:50,760 --> 00:14:57,140
Now I place a second warp vortex so that
I have easy access to your heart points.

294
00:14:58,180 --> 00:15:01,120
Strike ninja, jump into the warp vortex!

295
00:15:02,760 --> 00:15:03,960
Look at him come.

296
00:15:04,220 --> 00:15:06,340
That strike ninja really is fast.

297
00:15:10,440 --> 00:15:12,980
No, he's gone into the warp hole.

298
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:14,657
But that means...

299
00:15:14,740 --> 00:15:15,717
That's right, Devlin.

300
00:15:15,800 --> 00:15:18,840
He'll come out on your side of the field.

301
00:15:23,120 --> 00:15:26,960
Now, Strike Ninja, attack
and destroy his Ryukushin!

302
00:15:27,220 --> 00:15:28,960
Stealth slash attack!

303
00:15:33,060 --> 00:15:34,380
What's going on?

304
00:15:34,620 --> 00:15:35,660
Nothing happened.

305
00:15:38,380 --> 00:15:39,520
All right!

306
00:15:40,600 --> 00:15:43,600
Yugi, Yugi, Yugi, Yugi!

307
00:15:45,920 --> 00:15:47,757
Duke may have blocked
me from being able to

308
00:15:47,840 --> 00:15:49,837
extend my dungeon path
to his heart points,

309
00:15:49,920 --> 00:15:52,057
but thanks to the Warp Vortex he placed,

310
00:15:52,140 --> 00:15:55,357
I now have an even better way of
getting my monsters over to them.

311
00:15:55,440 --> 00:15:57,320
His portal became my way in.

312
00:15:57,580 --> 00:16:00,380
I can't believe Yugi got a rare black die.

313
00:16:00,740 --> 00:16:03,880
Now he's using the Warp
Vortex I summon against me.

314
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:07,957
And with that high-speed strike
ninja already deep in my territory,

315
00:16:08,040 --> 00:16:10,377
all Yugi has to do is
roll one movement press,

316
00:16:10,460 --> 00:16:13,857
and he'll be able to move him with
its striking range of my heart points.

317
00:16:13,940 --> 00:16:16,980
I have to stop it. Go! Dice roll!

318
00:16:17,460 --> 00:16:19,480
I need two summon crests.

319
00:16:21,320 --> 00:16:22,150
Ah!

320
00:16:22,260 --> 00:16:25,120
My roll failed me. Go! Dice roll!

321
00:16:27,340 --> 00:16:28,170
Perfect!

322
00:16:28,260 --> 00:16:29,800
A set of movement crests.

323
00:16:31,240 --> 00:16:32,920
Strike ninja! Advance!

324
00:16:34,000 --> 00:16:34,830
Oh, yeah!

325
00:16:35,100 --> 00:16:36,865
I love watching this dude run.

326
00:16:38,060 --> 00:16:39,600
Now, strike ninja!

327
00:16:39,920 --> 00:16:41,273
Attack his heart point!

328
00:16:41,580 --> 00:16:43,120
Lunging claw thrust!

329
00:16:45,040 --> 00:16:46,600
Attack! No!

330
00:16:50,280 --> 00:16:51,110
No!

331
00:16:51,440 --> 00:16:52,680
My hard point!

332
00:16:57,060 --> 00:16:57,890
Oh, man!

333
00:16:58,560 --> 00:16:59,860
That's one down!

334
00:17:00,100 --> 00:17:02,240
Yep, and two to go! Yes!

335
00:17:02,700 --> 00:17:04,040
Did you see that?

336
00:17:04,240 --> 00:17:05,680
That's my grandson!

337
00:17:08,440 --> 00:17:09,270
What?

338
00:17:11,760 --> 00:17:13,100
I'm sorry, Yu-Gi.

339
00:17:13,260 --> 00:17:17,037
It's just been so long since anyone's
destroyed one of my heart points.

340
00:17:17,120 --> 00:17:20,061
You should really give
yourself a pat on the back.

341
00:17:20,180 --> 00:17:24,140
Because I guarantee you, it's
not going to be happening again.

342
00:17:26,200 --> 00:17:28,020
Go, dice roll!

343
00:17:31,140 --> 00:17:31,970
Perfect.

344
00:17:32,160 --> 00:17:34,037
A level three summoning.

345
00:17:34,120 --> 00:17:40,100
Dimension the dice, and unlock
my undefeatable monster!

346
00:17:42,620 --> 00:17:46,080
I summon Orgoth the Relentless!

347
00:17:47,680 --> 00:17:48,960
And next,

348
00:17:49,180 --> 00:17:52,717
I'll use two magic crests
and activate Orgoth the

349
00:17:52,800 --> 00:17:57,200
Relentless's special attack to
raise his power from 20 to 30!

350
00:17:58,320 --> 00:17:59,580
And now,

351
00:17:59,740 --> 00:18:04,660
I'll use two of my stored movement crest
dice and position Orgoth for attack.

352
00:18:07,420 --> 00:18:10,100
Orgoth the Relentless,
attack, strike, ninja.

353
00:18:10,620 --> 00:18:11,973
Diamond, blade, strike!

354
00:18:15,760 --> 00:18:18,642
I'd better think fast if
I want to save my ninja.

355
00:18:20,200 --> 00:18:21,480
There. That's it.

356
00:18:22,020 --> 00:18:24,000
Your ninja has been destroyed.

357
00:18:24,520 --> 00:18:28,000
I wouldn't be so sure if I were you. What?

358
00:18:28,300 --> 00:18:30,277
Why don't you take a closer look, Devlin?

359
00:18:30,360 --> 00:18:31,540
What?

360
00:18:31,760 --> 00:18:33,580
I don't see any... Huh?

361
00:18:34,100 --> 00:18:34,930
No!

362
00:18:35,040 --> 00:18:36,760
It can't be! There!

363
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:37,980
In the smoke!

364
00:18:38,240 --> 00:18:39,540
The Strike Ninja!

365
00:18:41,360 --> 00:18:44,831
Sorry, Duke, but just before
Orgot the Relentless attacked,

366
00:18:44,940 --> 00:18:48,646
I activated my ninja's special
ability with a Storg Trap Crest.

367
00:18:48,800 --> 00:18:53,537
It allows him to quickly dodge any attack
that's waged against him and escape arm.

368
00:18:53,620 --> 00:18:57,837
I can't believe Yugi has taught himself
such an advanced defense maneuver!

369
00:18:57,920 --> 00:19:00,617
he's making me look like a novice at my

370
00:19:00,700 --> 00:19:05,457
own game I can't let him rattle have to

371
00:19:05,540 --> 00:19:10,037
remember that this kid is just a lousy
cheat he doesn't have the skills to win this

372
00:19:10,120 --> 00:19:15,257
match it's my role now Duke and now I

373
00:19:15,340 --> 00:19:18,897
can attack again strike ninja lunging claw

374
00:19:18,980 --> 00:19:22,457
thrust no not another one of my heart

375
00:19:22,540 --> 00:19:27,037
two down now I believe I've taken the lead

376
00:19:27,120 --> 00:19:32,577
now Devlin you little wannabe I swore
I'd have my revenge on you for cheating

377
00:19:32,660 --> 00:19:35,917
Pegasus and sabotaging my game and I will

378
00:19:36,000 --> 00:19:41,597
go dice roll now

379
00:19:41,680 --> 00:19:43,457
Orgoth show that ninja

380
00:19:43,540 --> 00:19:49,617
why you're called relentless oh no I
don't have any more traps in my crest pool

381
00:19:49,700 --> 00:19:55,440
there's no way for me to help my ninja
escape this time diamond Dragon Blade Strike!

382
00:19:58,400 --> 00:19:59,230
Oh, no!

383
00:19:59,420 --> 00:20:01,008
His ninja's been wiped out!

384
00:20:01,360 --> 00:20:02,190
Hmm.

385
00:20:02,300 --> 00:20:03,740
You were close, Yugi.

386
00:20:04,020 --> 00:20:06,079
Closer than anyone I've ever faced.

387
00:20:06,200 --> 00:20:09,537
But I'm afraid that close doesn't
cut it in Dungeon Dice Monsters.

388
00:20:09,620 --> 00:20:14,617
Sure, you may have one heart point more
than me, but I have Orgoth the Relentless,

389
00:20:14,700 --> 00:20:18,677
